    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Darkness is not void, but an unfinished canvas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your spray gun is no brush</i>, but an <strong>extension of perception</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647120/extras/b5b9bb2e68be0c1f23fe668f8e683003.poster.avif?t=1755187609\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647120/extras/b5b9bb2e68be0c1f23fe668f8e683003.webm?t=1755187609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647120/extras/b5b9bb2e68be0c1f23fe668f8e683003.mp4?t=1755187609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person exploration puzzle game set in a world of absolute darkness. Armed with a fluorescent spray gun, players must illuminate their path and activate ancient mechanisms. As you paint the void with glowing trails, the world's hidden contours gradually emerge before your eyes. Journey through forgotten ruins where each stroke of color revives dormant secrets, traverse luminous valleys painted with ethereal light, and ascend to solitary islands suspended among the stars. With every burst of pigment, you'll uncover the truth buried beneath the shadows, ultimately revealing the grand design of this enigmatic realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>luminescent stroke</strong> poses a question to the world,<br>Every <i>mark</i> receives darkness's reply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every application <strong>rewrites understanding</strong>,<br>Each glow <strong>reconfigures reality</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your <i>luminous traces</i>,<br>Find the exit in this world you illuminate\u2014<br>You are both <strong>explorer</strong> and <strong>cartographer</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Darkness is not void, but an unfinished canvas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your spray gun is no brush</i>, but an <strong>extension of perception</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647120/extras/b5b9bb2e68be0c1f23fe668f8e683003.poster.avif?t=1755187609\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647120/extras/b5b9bb2e68be0c1f23fe668f8e683003.webm?t=1755187609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647120/extras/b5b9bb2e68be0c1f23fe668f8e683003.mp4?t=1755187609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person exploration puzzle game set in a world of absolute darkness. Armed with a fluorescent spray gun, players must illuminate their path and activate ancient mechanisms. As you paint the void with glowing trails, the world's hidden contours gradually emerge before your eyes. Journey through forgotten ruins where each stroke of color revives dormant secrets, traverse luminous valleys painted with ethereal light, and ascend to solitary islands suspended among the stars. With every burst of pigment, you'll uncover the truth buried beneath the shadows, ultimately revealing the grand design of this enigmatic realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>luminescent stroke</strong> poses a question to the world,<br>Every <i>mark</i> receives darkness's reply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every application <strong>rewrites understanding</strong>,<br>Each glow <strong>reconfigures reality</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your <i>luminous traces</i>,<br>Find the exit in this world you illuminate\u2014<br>You are both <strong>explorer</strong> and <strong>cartographer</strong>.</p>",
